{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Valkyrie Saga",
    "steam_appid": 2663150,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663150/extras/1d5985555135a7c34052097d2754c9e2.avif?t=1729789637\" width=600 height=80 /></span><br><br>Valkyrie Saga is an indie, retro platformer styled after PSX classics, giving you a chance to embark on an epic odyssey! Play as Roll the Valkyrie, a divine warrior tasked by the gods with one mission: Stopping a floating island from crashing into the earth. Ascend the ancient skyborne land, explore ancient ruins full of enigmatic carvings, unlock their secrets - and stop the cataclysm!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663150/extras/40f2ec562c32258dc68a8ef19882ce6e.avif?t=1729789637\" width=600 height=80 /></span><br><br>Everything in Valkyrie Saga is designed to make you feel like a PSX player from 1994. From stunning graphics from the time, through the immersive soundtrack, to the most memorable thing that kept players glued to TV screens: Gameplay!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663150/extras/32f76e9bd587df107f0247970ca4507d.avif?t=1729789637\" width=600 height=80 /></span><br><br>As the divine warrior, you'll have to master both the art of soaring across the skies across the plummeting island, and the way of the blade, confronting otherworldly foes!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663150/extras/a29a3edba8a571e5a3251d5660bd1e6d.avif?t=1729789637\" width=600 height=80 /></span><br><br>Hidden among the ruins, cryptic scribblings, and odd twists of the world is a complex story to piece together, detailing what happened to the civilization that once occupied the island. Can you find out the truth before it is too late?",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663150/extras/1d5985555135a7c34052097d2754c9e2.avif?t=1729789637\" width=600 height=80 /></span><br><br>Valkyrie Saga is an indie, retro platformer styled after PSX classics, giving you a chance to embark on an epic odyssey! Play as Roll the Valkyrie, a divine warrior tasked by the gods with one mission: Stopping a floating island from crashing into the earth. Ascend the ancient skyborne land, explore ancient ruins full of enigmatic carvings, unlock their secrets - and stop the cataclysm!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663150/extras/40f2ec562c32258dc68a8ef19882ce6e.avif?t=1729789637\" width=600 height=80 /></span><br><br>Everything in Valkyrie Saga is designed to make you feel like a PSX player from 1994. From stunning graphics from the time, through the immersive soundtrack, to the most memorable thing that kept players glued to TV screens: Gameplay!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663150/extras/32f76e9bd587df107f0247970ca4507d.avif?t=1729789637\" width=600 height=80 /></span><br><br>As the divine warrior, you'll have to master both the art of soaring across the skies across the plummeting island, and the way of the blade, confronting otherworldly foes!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663150/extras/a29a3edba8a571e5a3251d5660bd1e6d.avif?t=1729789637\" width=600 height=80 /></span><br><br>Hidden among the ruins, cryptic scribblings, and odd twists of the world is a complex story to piece together, detailing what happened to the civilization that once occupied the island. Can you find out the truth before it is too late?",
    "short_description": "Join Roll the Valkyrie as she subverts fate in a retro indie platformer taking after PSX classics. Climb, dash, jump, and glide your way up a falling sky island, to stop it from destroying the world below. A straightforward quest that soon turns out to be much, much more...",
